[The large fixed-wall regression](../docs/reports/target_c_large_near_triangular_fixed_wall_lock_2026-10-05.md)
kills a generic strict-refill shortcut even for quadratic near-triangular
populations behind a linear unit wall. Every alternative grid labelling
